<title>USA: Intl CableTel sets $500 mln notes, pref'ds.</title>
<headline>Intl CableTel sets $500 mln notes, pref'ds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-part issue of debt and exchangeable preferred stock from International CableTel Inc was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette.</p>
<p>BORROWER INTERNATIONAL CABLETEL INC</p>
<p>AMT $400 MLN	 COUPON 10.00 PCT  MATURITY 2/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 8/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B3    YIELD 10.00 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 347 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 13.00 PCT  MATURITY 2/15/2009</p>
<p>TYPE EXCH PREF'DS  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST $ PAY DATE 5/15/04 LAST MOODY'S Caa   DIV YLD 13.00 PCT PAY FREQ QUARTERLY</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS			   CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES: SEVEN-YEAR PAY-IN-KIND (PIK) EXCHANGEABLE PREFERREDS.</p>
<p>	 FIRST PIK DATE 5/15/97.</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
